# (columns, indexes, the alerts notify trigger). Paths are relative to backend/. Order
# matters: the alerts trigger needs the alerts columns from 002. All files are idempotent.
# Used by scripts/setup/08-migrations.sh and by the db-extras service in docker-compose.yml.
